-out module into the base under a `# ── held-out oracles (merged from <name>_heldout.py) ──` divider; keep the base module docstring and append the held-out docstring's \"what it proves\" paragraph; dedupe identical definitions (192 across the 88 pairs, incl. `pytestmark`); rename differing definitions with the `_heldout` suffix and repoint callers; `git rm` the held-out file. Record per pair: `pytest --collect-only -q <base> <heldout>` before, `pytest --collect-only -q <base>` after.\n\nMechanism note: `tests/unit/test_audit_serve.py::_clean_ui_env` is a base-only autouse fixture (unchanged by the merge); no autouse key in this directory's pairs changes bucket."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788807489350293937,"uuid":"7923be93-7e40-4838-8f28-93b73b39dd93"}